{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"> Enter a neutral chemical reaction, then enter a value for each reactant in the order shown. Choose grams or moles. The calculator balances the equation, compares each value with its coefficient, and estimates each product. If you want to enter the actual mass of a product to calculate the percentage yield.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"stoichiometry-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"stoichiometry-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["stoichiometry-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ipasok ang isang neutral na kemikal na reaksyon, pagkatapos ay ipasok ang isang halaga para sa bawat reactant sa pagkakasunud-sunod na ipinapakita. Pumili gramo o moles. Ang kalkulador balanse ang equation, ihahambing ang bawat halaga sa koepisyent nito, at tinatayang bawat produkto. Kung gusto mo ipasok ang aktwal na masa ng isang produkto upang makalkula ang porsyento ng ani.","record_id":"c9980af7abcf4abba930650f4c908859b793930fdf3460ffb1c79e4c1444fbb4","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.2579389433750094,"source":"Enter a neutral chemical reaction, then enter one amount for each reactant in the order shown. Choose grams or moles. The calculator balances the equation, compares each amount with its coefficient, and estimates every product. Optionally enter the actual mass of one product to calculate percent yield.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"30acbcca12f0cc720ff1a0b451f2f4f52335f118892a813ded9d2b6b4c641848","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ipasok ang isang neutral na kemikal na reaksyon, pagkatapos ay ipasok ang isang halaga para sa bawat reactant sa pagkakasunud-sunod na ipinapakita. Pumili gramo o moles. Ang kalkulador balanse ang equation, ihahambing ang bawat halaga sa koepisyent nito, at tinatayang bawat produkto. Kung gusto mo ipasok ang aktwal na masa ng isang produkto upang makalkula ang porsyento ng ani.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
